description:
Name availability + similarity check BEFORE registering: NFKC-normalizes the name, reports whether it is taken, reserved, or malformed, and warns (never blocks) on homoglyph-skeleton collisions and edit-distance-1 neighbours. The check NEVER names the colliding handle — it reports categories only, so it cannot enumerate the book. Availability is advisory, not a reservation: registration is first-come. Authenticated callers only (rule B). Auth signature over "DAXNI-REGISTRAR-AUTH-v1
{your handle}
MCP:check_name_availability
/v1/names/check
{timestamp}
aud:daxni.com" (audience-bound).
